# Tailwind

- Use theme tokens (`text-hof`, `bg-rausch`, `gap-photo`) instead of raw hex.
- Photo mosaic gap is 8px (`gap-2`) with 12px outer radius — do not invent a third scale.
- Keep layout utilities in JSX so the workshop can read spacing in place.
- Desktop-only shell: `min-w-[1280px]`. Do not introduce a mobile redesign.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div className="text-[#222] p-[13px] bg-[#FF385C]">

// ✅ GOOD
<div className="text-hof p-3 bg-rausch">
```
